cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Practice cluster: a browser-based Slurm HPC simulator with a 7-lesson guide"
abstract: >-
  A safe, simulated Slurm supercomputer that runs in a web browser, with a
  7-lesson guide for learning HPC basics (files, modules, sinfo/squeue, sbatch,
  a Foldseek job, fixing a failed job, scancel/srun) before using a real
  cluster. Partition names, limits and software versions are invented and do
  not describe any real system.
